        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: G. V. Prakash Kumar, Ashrita Shetty, Vetrimaaran, Manimaran\n- Films: Udhayam NH4, Veyyil\n- Companies: S Pictures\n- Topics: soundtrack composition, casting, Tamil cinema\n\nFacts:\n- In 2006, G. V. Prakash Kumar's first film was S Pictures' \"Veyyil\".\n- By the early 2010s, G. V. Prakash Kumar became popular in Tamil cinema.\n- Vetrimaaran and Manimaran approached Ashrita Shetty to play the lead role in their film \"Udhayam NH4\".\n- G. V. Prakash Kumar composed the soundtrack and background score for \"Udhayam NH4\".",
